  "label": "User projected onto the confused driver",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man in the car looking confused, as the meme format invites the viewer to identify with the bewildered driver questioning an unclear instruction. The rhetorical question 'for what?' reinforces this projection by implying the user is in the same state of confusion as the driver.",
